1a66e" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444757 1075 #edb/ref 17592186444724 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444757 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444757 1077 "field-1" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444757 1078 #edb/ref 17592186444724 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444757 1079 #uuid "fa46a267-4b44-5006-945d-f0c780b1334e" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444743 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444754 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1069 "q-175309" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1071 "The coefficients of $z$ and $w$ of the expression $4z-2v-w$ are{{field-1}}\nand\n{{field-2}}\n, respectively." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1072 #uuid "2272cd41-1d55-5834-b251-13ac33998b0e" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444758 1074 "The terms of the expression are $4z,$ $-2v,$  and $-w.$ Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $4z$ is $4$,\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-2v$ is $-2$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-w$ is $-1.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of $z$ and $w$ of the given expression are $4$ and $-1,$ respectively." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444749 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1069 "q-44049" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1071 "What is the constant term in the expression $7p+\\frac{1}{5}-3q+r?$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1072 #uuid "2410df8a-af5f-5395-a8f7-6f01fb9b5a62" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444759 1074 "The expression has four terms: $7p$, $\\frac{1}{5}$, $-3q$ and $r.$ The only term that does not contain any variables is $\\frac{1}{5}$, so $\\frac{1}{5}$ is the constant term." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444745 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1069 "q-171468" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1071 "The constant term in the expression $4m+7n$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1072 #uuid "2bd1aa13-179d-5d50-b799-cdeceb985d71" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444760 1074 "The expression has two terms: \n\n$$\n4m\\,,\\,7n\n$$\n\n \n\nEach of these terms contains a variable, so none are constant.\n\nThe constant term is missing. However, we can include it by adding zero to the expression. Rewriting the given expression as\n\n$$\n4m+7n+0,\n$$\n\nwe see that the constant term is $0.$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444746 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1069 "q-175338" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1071 "The coefficient of $c$ in the expression  $\\frac{a}{4}-\\frac{2b}{3}-\\frac{3c}{5}$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1072 #uuid "3a1bccc4-dcaa-5037-affa-01c48877663d" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444761 1074 "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n\\frac{a}{4}\\,,\\,-\\frac{2b}{3}\\,,\\,-\\frac{3c}{5}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe only term with the variable $c$ is $-\\frac{3c}{5},$ so $-\\frac{3}{5}$ is the coefficient of $c.$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444752 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1069 "q-44235" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1071 "What is the coefficient of $r$ in the expression $\\frac{p}{3}+\\frac{2r}{3}+\\frac{1}{2}?$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1072 #uuid "3b6ff78f-5ae9-5640-bff0-d028984b3a83" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444762 1074 "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n\\frac{p}{3}\\,,\\,\\frac{2r}{3}\\,,\\,\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\nThe only term with the variable $r$ is $\\frac{2r}{3},$ so $\\frac{2}{3}$ is the coefficient of $r.$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444748 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1069 "q-44048" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1071 "What is the constant term in the expression $6-3x+2y?$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1072 #uuid "3f084ce4-122d-54f2-8959-73b35064d8ae" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444763 1074 "The expression has three terms: $6$, $-3x$ and $2y.$ The only term that does not contain any variables is $6$, so $6$ is the constant term." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444757 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1069 "q-175887" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1071 "The coefficient of $a$ in the expression $9a-2b+7$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1072 #uuid "3f37989f-b57a-5aea-8240-70da015f5138" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444764 1074 "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n9a\\,,\\,-2b\\,,\\,7\n$$\n\nThe only term with the variable $a$ is $9a,$ so $9$ is the coefficient of $a.$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444750 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444751 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1069 "q-175969" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1071 "The coefficients of $x$ and $y$ of the expression $x+4y$ are{{field-1}}\nand\n{{field-2}}\n, respectively." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1072 #uuid "50031aea-32a5-5fdf-84b7-ae97c029443e" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444765 1074 "The terms of the expression are $x$ and $4y.$ Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $x$ is $1$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $4y$ is $4.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of $x$ and $y$ of the given expression are $1$ and $4,$ respectively." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444756 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1069 "q-175371" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1071 "The constant term in the expression $3m-\\frac{5n}{6}+\\frac{1}{2}$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1072 #uuid "62dea677-f3f9-594c-972b-a951f4087b85" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444766 1074 "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n3m\\,,\\,-\\frac{5n}{6}\\,,\\,\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe only term that does not contain any variables is $\\frac{1}{2}$, so $\\frac{1}{2}$ is the constant term." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444753 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1069 "q-5003" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1071 "The coefficients of the expression $-2p-4q+9r$ are" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1072 #uuid "6fc23966-668e-556a-8201-5e4dfbc9499b" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444767 1074 "The terms of the expression are $-2p$, $-4q$ and $9r.$  Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-2p$ is $-2$,\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-4q$ is $-4$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $9r$ is $9.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of the expression are $-2$, $-4$ and $9.$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444755 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1069 "q-101489" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1071 "What is the constant term in the expression $\\frac{1}{6}y-\\frac{4}{9}-w+\\frac{1}{5}x?$" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1072 #uuid "a6ad512b-05d5-5a8e-92ba-aaa6e2d9bc0a" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444768 1074 "The expression has four terms: $\\frac{1}{6}y$, $-\\frac{4}{9}$, $-w$ and $\\frac{1}{5}x.$ The only term that does not contain any variables is $-\\frac{4}{9}$, so $-\\frac{4}{9}$ is the constant term." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444747 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1069 "q-176014" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1071 "The constant term in the expression $\\frac{3}{8}p-6-\\frac{3}{2}q$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1072 #uuid "c8eb1f28-793c-5aac-9e95-717919e5f9cd" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444769 1074 "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{8}p\\,,\\,-6\\,,\\,-\\frac{3}{2}q\n$$\n\nThe only term that does not contain any variables is $-6$, so $-6$ is the constant term." 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444770 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444744 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444770 1069 "q-101493" 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444770 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534932 17592186045417 true] [17592186444770 1071 "What is the value of the constant term in the expression 